flowchart TD

FromGuestReg[↩ From Fig. 3.2 — Guest Mode: Register]:::connector
FromSelectType[↩ From Fig. 3.2 — Select User Type: Registered User / Administrator]:::connector

subgraph REGISTER["Member Registration Workflow"]
    direction TB
    RegStart[Register]:::guest
    EnterAccountInfo[/Enter Account Information/]:::guest
    ValidateAccount[Validate Account Information]:::authNode
    AccountExists{Account Already Exists?}:::decisionNode
    DupMsg[Display Duplicate Account Message]:::errorNode
    CreateAccount[Create User Account]:::authNode
    StoreAccount[(Store Account in Database)]:::database
    RegSuccess[Registration Successful]:::authNode
end

FromGuestReg --> RegStart
RegStart --> EnterAccountInfo --> ValidateAccount --> AccountExists
AccountExists -->|Yes| DupMsg --> EnterAccountInfo
AccountExists -->|No| CreateAccount --> StoreAccount --> RegSuccess --> EnterCred

subgraph AUTH["Login and Authentication"]
    direction TB
    EnterCred[/Enter Username and Password/]:::authNode
    Authenticate[[Authenticate User]]:::authNode
    AuthSuccess{Authentication Successful?}:::decisionNode
    LoginError[Display Login Error]:::errorNode
    CheckRole[[Check User Role]]:::authNode
end

FromSelectType --> EnterCred
EnterCred --> Authenticate --> AuthSuccess
AuthSuccess -->|No| LoginError --> EnterCred
AuthSuccess -->|Yes| CheckRole

ToMember[↪ Fig. 3.4 — Open Member Functions]:::connector
ToAdmin[↪ Fig. 3.5 — Check Administrator Permission]:::connector
CheckRole -->|Registered User| ToMember
CheckRole -->|Administrator| ToAdmin

